{
    "title": "Sympla: Ingressos para eventos",
    "description": "If you play with Sympla, living is now! \ud83d\udc99\r\n\r\nFIND THE BEST EVENTS\r\n\r\nDiscover parties, plays, shows, stand up, tours and more event options near you. Whatever experience you are looking for, there is everything at Sympla!\r\n\r\nOUR APP HAS A NEW FACE!\r\n\r\nThe app just got even better! We created a brand new version for you, with a dark mode version and a completely new look. Now your tickets are inside the Wallet, where you can also find exclusive collectibles options.\r\n \r\nFind parties, shows, sightseeing tours, clubs, festivals, workshops, museums, gastronomic events, children's events and much more. Sympla is the largest events platform in Brazil. Download the app and discover what to do near you this weekend!\r\n\r\nBuy tickets online for thousands of events, shows, museums, children's events, parties, clubs, online courses, workshops and sporting events. In addition to several free event options, you will also find festivals, parks, plays, corporate events and much more.\r\n\r\nDISCOVER EVENTS NEAR YOU\r\n \r\nActivate your location, enter the Map and find events that will take place near you, from shows, stand up comedy, festivals, museums and tourist tours! Explore the best events in your city, be it S\u00e3o Paulo, Rio de Janeiro, Belo Horizonte, Porto Alegre, Florian\u00f3polis, Salvador or Recife... No matter where you are, filter your search based on your location and don't miss anything else .\r\n\r\nYou can also find events and filter them according to type \u2013 such as parties, shows, courses and plays \u2013 as well as the desired date and also by places near you or specific cities.\r\nOnce you find your favorite event, just invite the family for outdoor walks, visits to museums and exhibitions, plays, take the children to summer camps, parks and workshops or gather friends for parties, shows, festivals and ballads. On the Sympla app, you will also find thousands of free events.\r\n\r\nBUY YOUR TICKETS ON THE APP\r\n \r\nWhether for a party or the theater, you can buy tickets online for events safely and quickly on the Sympla app. All your tickets are stored in the app itself and you can access them whenever you want. You don't need to print tickets for the event, just show them on your cell phone screen. The Sympla app also has integration with Google Wallet!\r\n \r\nFAVORITE AND SHARE EVENTS\r\n \r\nWhen you find an event, you can add it to your Favorites list and access it easily. This way, you can check out your favorite events without having to do a new search.\r\n \r\nYou can also share any event with your friends on social media directly from the Sympla app. Do you want to invite friends to bars, parties, outings, shows, festivals or plays? Share with them!\r\n\r\nFIND THE BEST EVENTS\r\n\r\nFind events happening today or next weekend near you. Plan ahead for upcoming parties and festivals and discover what\u2019s trending right now.\r\nDownload the Sympla app and find the best events in Brazil!",
    "descriptionHTML": "If you play with Sympla, living is now! \ud83d\udc99<br><br>FIND THE BEST EVENTS<br><br>Discover parties, plays, shows, stand up, tours and more event options near you. Whatever experience you are looking for, there is everything at Sympla!<br><br>OUR APP HAS A NEW FACE!<br><br>The app just got even better! We created a brand new version for you, with a dark mode version and a completely new look. Now your tickets are inside the Wallet, where you can also find exclusive collectibles options.<br> <br>Find parties, shows, sightseeing tours, clubs, festivals, workshops, museums, gastronomic events, children&#39;s events and much more. Sympla is the largest events platform in Brazil. Download the app and discover what to do near you this weekend!<br><br>Buy tickets online for thousands of events, shows, museums, children&#39;s events, parties, clubs, online courses, workshops and sporting events. In addition to several free event options, you will also find festivals, parks, plays, corporate events and much more.<br><br>DISCOVER EVENTS NEAR YOU<br> <br>Activate your location, enter the Map and find events that will take place near you, from shows, stand up comedy, festivals, museums and tourist tours! Explore the best events in your city, be it S\u00e3o Paulo, Rio de Janeiro, Belo Horizonte, Porto Alegre, Florian\u00f3polis, Salvador or Recife... No matter where you are, filter your search based on your location and don&#39;t miss anything else .<br><br>You can also find events and filter them according to type \u2013 such as parties, shows, courses and plays \u2013 as well as the desired date and also by places near you or specific cities.<br>Once you find your favorite event, just invite the family for outdoor walks, visits to museums and exhibitions, plays, take the children to summer camps, parks and workshops or gather friends for parties, shows, festivals and ballads. On the Sympla app, you will also find thousands of free events.<br><br>BUY YOUR TICKETS ON THE APP<br> <br>Whether for a party or the theater, you can buy tickets online for events safely and quickly on the Sympla app. All your tickets are stored in the app itself and you can access them whenever you want. You don&#39;t need to print tickets for the event, just show them on your cell phone screen. The Sympla app also has integration with Google Wallet!<br> <br>FAVORITE AND SHARE EVENTS<br> <br>When you find an event, you can add it to your Favorites list and access it easily. This way, you can check out your favorite events without having to do a new search.<br> <br>You can also share any event with your friends on social media directly from the Sympla app. Do you want to invite friends to bars, parties, outings, shows, festivals or plays? Share with them!<br><br>FIND THE BEST EVENTS<br><br>Find events happening today or next weekend near you. Plan ahead for upcoming parties and festivals and discover what\u2019s trending right now.<br>Download the Sympla app and find the best events in Brazil!",
